This component pulls in epdiy (https://github.com/vroland/epdiy) as a build-time
managed component. epdiy's driver/firmware is licensed under the GNU Lesser GPL
v3 (LGPL-3.0). It is fetched separately at build time and is not redistributed
in this repository.
